# Pairs with SetComplete. A capture that faults part-way is accepted with
# whatever members it had captured, instead of failing.
MODULE: SetCompleteFaultAccepts
TARGET: SetComplete
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a faulted capture attempt is accepted rather than failed
PERTURBS: CaptureFault

--- FIND
    /\ phase \in {"fence", "drain", "gating", "capture"}
    /\ phase' = "failed"
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase \in {"fence", "drain", "gating", "capture"}
    \* MUTATION: the fault path accepts.
    /\ phase' = "done"
--- END
